{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2023-01-26 10:00:00', 'title': "LILLY SUPPORTS DIRECT RELIEF'S EFFORTS TO EXPAND ACCESS TO MEDICINES BY IMPROVING COLD CHAIN CAPACITY", 'text': '$1.15M CONTRIBUTION FROM LILLY WILL FUND THE PURCHASE AND INSTALLATION OF 150 REFRIGERATION UNITS BY DIRECT RELIEF IN LOW- AND MIDDLE-INCOME COUNTRIES AROUND THE WORLD INDIANAPOLIS AND SANTA BARBARA, CALIF. , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) AND DIRECT RELIEF TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW INITIATIVE TO EXPAND ACCESS TO MEDICINES IN LOW- AND MIDDLE-INCOME COUNTRIES BY BOOSTING COLD CHAIN CAPACITY IN 17 COUNTRIES.'}